{"v":1,"accession":"PRJNA1429842","title":"Elevated suspended particulate matter reorganises carbon fraction in mangrove ecosystems","description":"Mangrove wetlands are a core component of blue carbon ecosystems worldwide. Elevated suspended particulate matter (SPM) in natural waters is a ubiquitous environmental stressor, yet its effects on the carbon cycling of mangroves remain poorly unelucidated. Here, we conducted a 90-day microcosm experiment using Kandelia obovata, a representative mangrove species, and integrated high-resolution chemical and biological profiling to systematically elucidate how SPM loading affects mangrove carbon-cycling processes.","center":"CHONGQINGJIAOTONGUNIVERSITY","data_type":"Raw sequence reads","submission_date":"2026/02/28 00:00","sample_cols":["accession","title","tier","context","collection_date","collection_year","country","region","place_id","place","location_status","lat","lon","submitted_location","isolation_source","env_broad_scale","env_local_scale","env_medium","eligibility_reason"],"samples":[["SAMN56256273","W1-0","uncertain",null,"2024-10-24",2024,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,"water samles",null,null,null,"no environmental-sample evidence"],["SAMN56256274","W2-0","uncertain",null,"2024-10-24",2024,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,"water samles",null,null,null,"no environmental-sample evidence"],["SAMN56256275","W3-0","uncertain",null,"2024-10-24",2024,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,"water samles",null,null,null,"no environmental-sample evidence"],["SAMN56256276","W4-30","uncertain",null,"2024-10-24",2024,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,"water samles",null,null,null,"no environmental-sample evidence"],["SAMN56256277","W5-30","uncertain",null,"2024-10-24",2024,null,null,null,null,"unresolved",null,null,null,"water samles",null,null,null,"no environmental-sample evidence"],["SAMN56256278","W6-30","uncertain",null,"2024-10-24",2024,null,null,null,null,"unres